  "body": "A small release that:\r\n\r\n- adapts `isd` to the recent `textual` changes,\r\n- improves ansi themes,\r\n- fixes journalctl output for user services without persistent storage,\r\n- switched to Zensical from MkDocs Material, and\r\n- updates the Python and nix dependencies.\r\n\r\nWith `textual` 8.2.5, upstream now provides `ansi-dark` and `ansi-light` themes that cover\r\nthe use case of the experimental `terminal-derived-theme`.\r\nThis release deprecates `terminal-derived-theme` in favor of those upstream themes.\r\nSelecting the old theme still works, but `isd` now shows a warning notification pointing to the alternatives.\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kainctl/isd/compare/v0.6.2...v0.6.3",
